{"code":"const NL = String.fromCharCode(10);
const cmd = [
"cd D:\\FPGA",
"git add project_8/rtl/frame_fifo_pump.v project_8/rtl/aurora_udp_bridge.v project_8/rtl/udp/udp.v project_8/rtl/udp/udp_rx.v project_8/rtl/udp/udp_tx.v project_8/scripts/build_debug.tcl project_8/sim/tb_full_chain.v project_8/sim/async_fifo_model.v",
"git -c user.name='fpga-dev' -c user.email='dev@local' commit -m 'project_8 fix: 帧泵 rd_empty off-by-one —— 历代位流 ping/UDP 不通的第二根因' -m '根因: rd_empty 误用 rd_bin_next 提前一拍判空, 每帧最后一字节被拒读 → 回显帧尾截断 → PC 按 FCS 丢弃. 与板上 \"4 ping 收 1\" 现象吻合 (复位后首帧幸存).' -m '修复(C21): rd_empty = bin2gray(rd_bin) == wr_ptr_g_s2; 本泵整帧先写满再读, 读期间写指针稳定, 用当前指针判空安全.' -m '整链仿真 tb_full_chain.v (官方栈+双帧泵+打包/解包+Aurora AXIS 模型): ARP 请求/回复 + UDP 16B/29B/200B 共 5 帧逐字节全对, 三级字节数 553=553=553 零丢失; 源端口回显同步验证.' -m '同批入库(09-10 ds 会话遗留未提交): UDP 回显目标端口=发送方源端口(改动B), 帧泵丢帧计数器修复(改动C), ILA 接收侧探针; 新位流 WNS=+0.946ns (out/ 不入库).' -m '附带发现: 仿真侧两处自坑已修 —— Aurora 模型不得丢 beat(只在 beat 间插空拍); UDP 协议号=0x11 非 0x17.'",
"git log --oneline -2",
"git status --short | Select-Object -First 8"
].join(NL);
const r = await tools.pwsh({ command: cmd, description: "Commit pump fix and sim files" });
console.log(r.stdout.text);
console.log(r.stderr.text.slice(0,600));","description":"Commit the root-cause fix to git"}

