{"code":"const NL = String.fromCharCode(10);
const msg = [
"project_8: M2 达成 —— RX_DLY_PS 500->1250ps 眼图居中, 上板判据全过",
"",
"延迟扫描: 500ps 时 RX 字节恢复(ILA 整帧 ARP 完美, arp_rx_done/stack_tx_en/rx_tvalid",
"三事件触发)但 ping ~50% + MISCOMPARE => 眼边缘偶发位翻转; 1250ps 居中后:",
"  ping 10/10 与 20/20 均 0% 丢包全 <1ms;",
"  udp_verify 12/12 逐字节一致(覆盖全部 帧长%8 余数类), 压力 36/36;",
"  PASS: 数据已确认穿越 Aurora 64b/66b 编解码往返.",
"",
"三根因史: unpack 帧中断流(09-10) -> 帧泵 rd_empty off-by-one(09-17上午) ->",
"RGMII RX 采样相位(09-17下午定位, 09-18 IDELAY 1250ps 收敛).",
"附 ila_cap_arp.tcl(arp_rx_done 触发抓包, TRIGGER_POSITION 属性兼容处理)."
].join(NL);
await tools.write({ file_path: "D:/FPGA/project_8/docs/commit_msg_m2.txt", content: msg });
const cmd = [
"cd D:\\FPGA",
"git add project_8/rtl/rgmii_rx_fix2.v project_8/scripts/ila_cap_arp.tcl project_8/scripts/board_test_rxfix.ps1",
"git -c user.name='fpga-dev' -c user.email='dev@local' commit -F project_8\\docs\\commit_msg_m2.txt 2>&1 | Select-Object -First 4",
"Remove-Item project_8\\docs\\commit_msg_m2.txt -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue",
"git log --oneline -3"
].join(NL);
const r = await tools.pwsh({ command: cmd, description: "Commit M2 achievement to git" });
console.log(r.stdout.text);","description":"Commit M2 final results"}

