{"code":"await tools.edit({ file_path: "D:/FPGA/project_9/rtl/aurora_udp_bridge.v",
old_string: "//      --> Aurora 64b/66b TX --> GT 内环(loopback=3'b010) --> Aurora RX",
new_string: "//      --> Aurora 64b/66b TX --> SFP+ 真光链路(loopback=3'b000) --> Aurora RX" });
console.log("header comment fixed");
const NL = String.fromCharCode(10);
const msg = [
"project_9: 真光链路版 —— loopback 3'b010(内环) -> 3'b000(正常), 首版位流 WNS=+0.936ns",
"",
"从 prj8(M2 判据全过) 复制验证过的资产: 官方栈+双帧泵+打包/解包+IDELAY1250ps 的 rgmii_rx_fix2;",
"剔除死实验文件(rgmii_rx.v 官方原件/fix.v PlanA/_dly 两个)防同名模块冲突.",
"",
"真链路要素: Aurora 10Gbps(C_LINE_RATE=10000), sfp_tx_disable=0 开激光, rs0=rs1=1 高速档.",
"预期行为: 无光模块/无环回时 T23 灭(channel_up=0, 帧泵硬门控, 板子静默=正常);",
"插 10G SFP+ 并自环后 T23 常亮 -> ping/udp_verify 与 prj8 同判据.",
"后续计划: 连通性过后加 IBERT 眼图(IBERT 与 Aurora 不能共占同一 GT, 用换装方案或同 quad 空闲通道)."
].join(NL);
await tools.write({ file_path: "D:/FPGA/project_9/docs/commit_msg_p9.txt", content: msg });
const cmd = [
"New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force D:\\FPGA\\project_9\\docs | Out-Null",
"cd D:\\FPGA",
"git add project_9/rtl project_9/xdc project_9/scripts/create_project.tcl project_9/scripts/build_debug.tcl project_9/scripts/program_board.tcl project_9/docs/commit_msg_p9.txt",
"git -c user.name='fpga-dev' -c user.email='dev@local' commit -F project_9\\docs\\commit_msg_p9.txt 2>&1 | Select-Object -First 3",
"Remove-Item project_9\\docs\\commit_msg_p9.txt",
"git log --oneline -1"
].join(NL);
const r = await tools.pwsh({ command: cmd, description: "Commit prj9 creation to git" });
console.log(r.stdout.text);","description":"Fix comment and commit prj9"}

